      "status": "host_patch_implemented_and_local_regressions_passed_native_ci_pending",
      "description": "New per-launch HTTP ports changed localStorage origin while previous native bridge only preserved CF/QQ keys. Three games would lose access to saves across macOS launches. Fixed in host via declared exact game storageKeys, per-bundle native store, initial hydration and set/remove/clear synchronization. No original game rules changed.",
